# themes/nord — static Nord-flavoured dark palette.
#
# Generated by scripts/theme/colorgen.sh from a seed image of four equal
# blocks — Polar Night nord0 #2E3440, aurora red nord11 #BF616A, frost
# nord8 #88C0D0 and aurora green nord14 #A3BE8C — then committed as a
# static palette. Produced by the real engine rather than hand-written
# hex, so it is guaranteed to parse and to carry every key a template can
# reference (89 dcol_* keys).
#
# The four dcol_pry values below are those seed colours verbatim; every
# accent ramp and text colour is this engine dark curve rather than
# anything Nord publishes. Nord-flavoured, not a faithful port.
# Upstream: nordtheme/nord (MIT). See CREDITS.md.
#
# Applied with:  scripts/theme/theme-apply.sh nord
# Dark only — this project has no light mode.
#
dcol_mode="dark"
dcol_pry1="2E3440"
dcol_pry1_rgba="46,52,64,255"
dcol_txt1="FFFFFF"
dcol_txt1_rgba="255,255,255,255"
